 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Staging v4. 90-91: a group of deniers in a town at dusk, speaking and shaking their heads; a book plate for «القرآن» (no book in their hands). 92-93 (the questioning on the Day) stay ambient. 94-97 address the Prophet ﷺ, who is never shown: ambient light, a book plate for the call, light for consolation. 98-99: believers in a prayer hall at night stand, prostrate, rise and bow (the remedy As-Sa'di names: remembrance, glorification and prayer). Not glossed: 90 (Al-Muyassar: those who divided the Quran; As-Sa'di: those who divided against the message), 96:1-6 (both tafsirs repeat «مع الله»). «اليقين» is death by both tafsirs."
